   00123| # GNU timeout bounds one node's Agent CLI turn (plan 01 step 3): the leaves
   00124| # that produced no proof ran 236 s, 162 s and 125 s against a 22 s median, and
   00125| # nothing stopped them. The default is ten times that median and above every
   00126| # passing leaf measured. Where `timeout` is absent (macOS without coreutils)
   00127| # the node runs unbounded, and the summary says so.
   00128| if command -v setsid >/dev/null 2>&1; then SETSID=(setsid); else SETSID=(); fi
